<answer>We invoke the sum of infinite geometric series formula:
${S}_{\infty}=\dfrac{a}{1-r} {/eq}
Plug the values of {eq}a {/eq} and {eq}r {/eq} into the {eq}\boxed{{\mathbf S=S_\infty=\dfrac{a}{1-r}}}{/eq} formula and simplify the fraction.
