{eq}S = \dfrac{1}{1-1/2} {/eq}
{eq}S=\dfrac{1}{1/2} {/eq}
{eq}S=1\times \dfrac{2}{1} {/eq}
{eq}\mathbf{S}=2 {/eq}
Answer: The sum of the geometric series {eq}\boxed{\Sigma^\infty_{n=0}(1/3)^n = 2}{/eq}
